        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "I hereby authorize the Verizon North Inc. to deduct from the second payroll period each month the sum of $_____ and to forward that amount to the International Brotherhood of Electrical Workers, Committee on Political Education. This authorization is signed voluntarily and not out of any fear of reprisal and on the understanding that IBEW-COPE is engaged in a joint fundraising effort with the AFL-CIO, will use the money contributed to that effort to make political contributions and expenditures in connection with federal and state elections, and that this voluntary authorization may be revoked at any time by notifying the Company and IBEW-COPE in writing of a desire to do so. Contributions or gifts to IBEW-COPE are not deductible as charitable contributions for federal income tax purposes.",
